{
    "meta": {
        "id": "scene11",
        "title": "Ruang Kerja Victor Hale — Konfrontasi",
        "background": "mansion-office",
        "entry": "scene11_n001"
    },
    "nodes": [
        {
            "id": "scene11_n001",
            "type": "narration",
            "text": "{playerName} tanpa sengaja masuk ke ruang kerja. Ia melihat sebuah foto lama di atas meja. Foto Samuel Ravenscroft bersama Victor Hale. Di belakangnya tertulis: 'Kesepakatan terakhir.'",
            "next": "scene11_n002"
        },
        {
            "id": "scene11_n002",
            "type": "narration",
            "text": "{playerName} membuka laci. Puluhan dokumen bertuliskan RAVENSCROFT memenuhi isinya. Di halaman terakhir, dua tanda tangan: Samuel Ravenscroft. Azaroth.",
            "next": "scene11_n003"
        },
        {
            "id": "scene11_n003",
            "type": "line",
            "speaker": "{playerName}",
            "expression": "serious",
            "text": "(membelalak) ...Azaroth?",
            "next": "scene11_n004"
        },
        {
            "id": "scene11_n004",
            "type": "narration",
            "text": "Tep... Tep... Tep... Suara tepuk tangan terdengar dari belakang. Victor berdiri di ambang pintu. Senyumnya kini berbeda.",
            "next": "scene11_n005"
        },
        {
            "id": "scene11_n005",
            "type": "line",
            "speaker": "azaroth",
            "expression": "smile",
            "characters": [
                {
                    "characterId": "azaroth",
                    "expression": "smile",
                    "position": "center",
                    "isSpeaking": true
                }
            ],
            "text": "(smirk) Apakah aku sudah ketahuan?",
            "next": "scene11_n006"
        },
        {
            "id": "scene11_n006",
            "type": "line",
            "speaker": "{playerName}",
            "expression": "serious",
            "characters": [
                {
                    "characterId": "azaroth",
                    "expression": "smile",
                    "position": "center",
                    "isSpeaking": false
                }
            ],
            "text": "(menggenggam pistolnya) Jadi... Kaulah pembunuh mereka.",
            "next": "scene11_n007"
        },
        {
            "id": "scene11_n007",
            "type": "line",
            "speaker": "azaroth",
            "expression": "smile",
            "characters": [
                {
                    "characterId": "azaroth",
                    "expression": "smile",
                    "position": "center",
                    "isSpeaking": true
                }
            ],
            "text": "(tertawa) Biar aku perkenalkan diri ku lagi dari awal. Diri ku Azaroth, rekan bisnis ayah tercintamu.",
            "next": "scene11_n008"
        },
        {
            "id": "scene11_n008",
            "type": "narration",
            "text": "Beberapa pria bersenjata masuk. Mereka menyeret Elenna. Tangannya terikat. Sebuah pistol menempel di kepalanya.",
            "next": "scene11_n009"
        },
        {
            "id": "scene11_n009",
            "type": "line",
            "speaker": "elenna",
            "expression": "neutral",
            "characters": [
                {
                    "characterId": "elenna",
                    "expression": "neutral",
                    "position": "center",
                    "isSpeaking": true
                }
            ],
            "text": "K-Kak... Aku minta maaf... Aku benar-benar nggak tahu... Aku kira beliau teman Om Samuel... dia memanfaatkan ku (air matanya jatuh) Aku... pengkhianat.",
            "next": "scene11_n010"
        },
        {
            "id": "scene11_n010",
            "type": "line",
            "speaker": "azaroth",
            "expression": "smile",
            "characters": [
                {
                    "characterId": "azaroth",
                    "expression": "smile",
                    "position": "center",
                    "isSpeaking": true
                }
            ],
            "text": "(tertawa) Anak itu sangat berguna. Dia memberiku semua informasi yang kubutuhkan.",
            "next": "scene11_n011"
        },
        {
            "id": "scene11_n011",
            "type": "narration",
            "text": "Azaroth meletakkan sebuah kontrak di atas meja.",
            "next": "scene11_n012"
        },
        {
            "id": "scene11_n012",
            "type": "line",
            "speaker": "azaroth",
            "expression": "neutral",
            "characters": [
                {
                    "characterId": "azaroth",
                    "expression": "neutral",
                    "position": "center",
                    "isSpeaking": true
                }
            ],
            "text": "Tandatangani. Bisnismu menjadi milikku. Atau... (menodongkan pistol ke kepala Elenna) ...dia mati.",
            "next": "scene11_n013"
        },
        {
            "id": "scene11_n013",
            "type": "line",
            "speaker": "elenna",
            "expression": "neutral",
            "characters": [
                {
                    "characterId": "elenna",
                    "expression": "neutral",
                    "position": "center",
                    "isSpeaking": true
                }
            ],
            "text": "(menggeleng) Jangan... Jangan lakukan, {playerName}.",
            "next": "scene11_n014"
        },
        {
            "id": "scene11_n014",
            "type": "narration",
            "text": "{playerName} membeku. Kontrak itu persis seperti sepuluh tahun lalu.",
            "next": "scene11_n015"
        },
        {
            "id": "scene11_n015",
            "type": "choice",
            "options": [
                {
                    "text": "Tandatangani kontrak - Setidaknya Elenna selamat...",
                    "goTo": "scene11_sign"
                },
                {
                    "text": "Mengulur waktu - Aku butuh kesempatan...",
                    "goTo": "scene11_stall"
                },
                {
                    "text": "Robek kontrak - Sejarah tidak akan terulang lagi.",
                    "goTo": "scene11_rip"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "scene11_sign",
            "type": "narration",
            "text": "{playerName} perlahan mengambil pena. Tangannya gemetar.",
            "next": "scene11_sign_02"
        },
        {
            "id": "scene11_sign_02",
            "type": "line",
            "speaker": "azaroth",
            "expression": "smile",
            "characters": [
                {
                    "characterId": "azaroth",
                    "expression": "smile",
                    "position": "center",
                    "isSpeaking": true
                }
            ],
            "text": "Seperti ayahmu. Keluarga Ravenscroft... selalu memilih cinta di atas segalanya.",
            "next": "scene11_sign_03"
        },
        {
            "id": "scene11_sign_03",
            "type": "narration",
            "text": "{playerName} menandatangani kontrak. Pulpen jatuh dari tangannya.",
            "next": "scene11_sign_04"
        },
        {
            "id": "scene11_sign_04",
            "type": "line",
            "speaker": "azaroth",
            "expression": "smile",
            "characters": [
                {
                    "characterId": "azaroth",
                    "expression": "smile",
                    "position": "center",
                    "isSpeaking": true
                }
            ],
            "text": "Terima kasih... atas perusahaanmu. Releas kan dia.",
            "next": "scene11_sign_05"
        },
        {
            "id": "scene11_sign_05",
            "type": "narration",
            "text": "BRAK!! Pintu didobrak. Keyna masuk... tapi terlambat. Azaroth sudah menghilang bersama anak buahnya. Yang tersisa hanyalah kontrak yang tertandatangani dan rasa sesal yang tak terperi.",
            "next": "scene11_sign_06"
        },
        {
            "id": "scene11_sign_06",
            "type": "line",
            "speaker": "{playerName}",
            "expression": "neutral",
            "text": "(mata berkaca-kaca) ...Aku sudah memilih.",
            "next": "scene11_sign_07"
        },
        {
            "id": "scene11_sign_07",
            "type": "scene-change",
            "targetSceneId": "scene12_bad"
        },
        {
            "id": "scene11_stall",
            "type": "line",
            "speaker": "{playerName}",
            "expression": "neutral",
            "characters": [
                {
                    "characterId": "azaroth",
                    "expression": "neutral",
                    "position": "center",
                    "isSpeaking": false
                }
            ],
            "text": "Aku mau tanya dulu. Sebelum aku putuskan.",
            "next": "scene11_stall_02"
        },
        {
            "id": "scene11_stall_02",
            "type": "line",
            "speaker": "azaroth",
            "expression": "neutral",
            "characters": [
                {
                    "characterId": "azaroth",
                    "expression": "neutral",
                    "position": "center",
                    "isSpeaking": true
                }
            ],
            "text": "(mengangguk) Silakan. Pertanyaan terakhir adalah hakmu.",
            "next": "scene11_stall_03"
        },
        {
            "id": "scene11_stall_03",
            "type": "line",
            "speaker": "{playerName}",
            "expression": "serious",
            "characters": [
                {
                    "characterId": "azaroth",
                    "expression": "neutral",
                    "position": "center",
                    "isSpeaking": false
                }
            ],
            "text": "Kenapa harus keluargaku?",
            "next": "scene11_stall_04"
        },
        {
            "id": "scene11_stall_04",
            "type": "line",
            "speaker": "azaroth",
            "expression": "smile",
            "characters": [
                {
                    "characterId": "azaroth",
                    "expression": "smile",
                    "position": "center",
                    "isSpeaking": true
                }
            ],
            "text": "Karena mereka... adalah satu-satunya yang bisa kupaksa menandatangani kontrak ini. Tidak dengan ancaman ke orang asing. Harus keluarga.",
            "next": "scene11_stall_05"
        },
        {
            "id": "scene11_stall_05",
            "type": "narration",
            "text": "{playerName} melirik jam di dinding. Azaroth menyadari... terlambat.",
            "next": "scene11_stall_06"
        },
        {
            "id": "scene11_stall_06",
            "type": "narration",
            "text": "BRAK!! Pintu didobrak. Keyna masuk dengan pasukannya. Dalam sekejap, Azaroth dan anak buahnya sudah terkepung.",
            "next": "scene11_stall_07"
        },
        {
            "id": "scene11_stall_07",
            "type": "line",
            "speaker": "keyna",
            "expression": "neutral",
            "characters": [
                {
                    "characterId": "keyna",
                    "expression": "neutral",
                    "position": "center",
                    "isSpeaking": true
                }
            ],
            "text": "Azaroth. Akhirnya kita ketemu. Atau lebih tepatnya... kita harusnya ketemu sepuluh tahun lalu.",
            "next": "scene11_stall_08"
        },
        {
            "id": "scene11_stall_08",
            "type": "line",
            "speaker": "azaroth",
            "expression": "serious",
            "characters": [
                {
                    "characterId": "azaroth",
                    "expression": "serious",
                    "position": "center",
                    "isSpeaking": true
                }
            ],
            "text": "(terdiam) ...Kau? Bagaimana bisa—",
            "next": "scene11_stall_09"
        },
        {
            "id": "scene11_stall_09",
            "type": "line",
            "speaker": "{playerName}",
            "expression": "smile",
            "characters": [
                {
                    "characterId": "azaroth",
                    "expression": "serious",
                    "position": "center",
                    "isSpeaking": false
                }
            ],
            "text": "(tersenyum) Aku punya waktu. Dan aku tahu siapa yang perlu kutelepon.",
            "next": "scene11_stall_10"
        },
        {
            "id": "scene11_stall_10",
            "type": "narration",
            "text": "Elenna dibebaskan. Azaroth ditembak di kakinya agar tidak bisa kabur. Akhirnya, setelah sepuluh tahun... keadilan datang.",
            "next": "scene11_stall_11"
        },
        {
            "id": "scene11_stall_11",
            "type": "line",
            "speaker": "keyna",
            "expression": "smile",
            "characters": [
                {
                    "characterId": "keyna",
                    "expression": "smile",
                    "position": "center",
                    "isSpeaking": true
                }
            ],
            "text": "Kau melakukan hal yang benar, {playerName}. Ravenscroft... sudah lama menunggu untuk ini.",
            "next": "scene11_stall_12"
        },
        {
            "id": "scene11_stall_12",
            "type": "scene-change",
            "targetSceneId": "scene12"
        },
        {
            "id": "scene11_rip",
            "type": "narration",
            "text": "{playerName} menatap kontrak itu. Bayangan ayahterangnya melintas di benak. Bayangan kesepuluh tahun yang hilang.",
            "next": "scene11_rip_02"
        },
        {
            "id": "scene11_rip_02",
            "type": "line",
            "speaker": "{playerName}",
            "expression": "serious",
            "characters": [
                {
                    "characterId": "azaroth",
                    "expression": "neutral",
                    "position": "center",
                    "isSpeaking": false
                }
            ],
            "text": "Tidak.",
            "next": "scene11_rip_03"
        },
        {
            "id": "scene11_rip_03",
            "type": "narration",
            "text": "SREEK!! {playerName} merobek kontrak menjadi dua. Lalu lagi. Lalu lagi. Kertas berserakan di lantai.",
            "next": "scene11_rip_04"
        },
        {
            "id": "scene11_rip_04",
            "type": "line",
            "speaker": "azaroth",
            "expression": "serious",
            "characters": [
                {
                    "characterId": "azaroth",
                    "expression": "serious",
                    "position": "center",
                    "isSpeaking": true
                }
            ],
            "text": "(menggenggam pistolnya erat) Kau... baru saja membuat kesalahan terbesar dalam hidupmu.",
            "next": "scene11_rip_05"
        },
        {
            "id": "scene11_rip_05",
            "type": "narration",
            "text": "BRAK!! {playerName} melompat ke samping saat Azaroth menembak. DOR! DOR! DOR! Peluru menghantam dinding di belakang tempatnya berdiri.",
            "next": "scene11_rip_06"
        },
        {
            "id": "scene11_rip_06",
            "type": "narration",
            "text": "BRAK!! Pintu didobrak. Keyna masuk... tapi di saat yang sama, peluru juga找到了 sasaran. Rasa panas menembus dada {playerName}.",
            "next": "scene11_rip_07"
        },
        {
            "id": "scene11_rip_07",
            "type": "narration",
            "text": "{playerName} jatuh. Darah mengucur. Pandangannya kabur. Suara tembakan bergema... lalu perlahan... hening.",
            "next": "scene11_rip_08"
        },
        {
            "id": "scene11_rip_08",
            "type": "narration",
            "text": "Samar-samar, seseorang berlutut di samping {playerName}. Rambut hitam. Mata biru yang familiar.",
            "next": "scene11_rip_09"
        },
        {
            "id": "scene11_rip_09",
            "type": "line",
            "speaker": "xyera",
            "expression": "neutral",
            "characters": [
                {
                    "characterId": "xyera",
                    "expression": "neutral",
                    "position": "center",
                    "isSpeaking": true
                }
            ],
            "text": "...Kau memang keras kepala.",
            "next": "scene11_rip_10"
        },
        {
            "id": "scene11_rip_10",
            "type": "line",
            "speaker": "{playerName}",
            "expression": "neutral",
            "characters": [
                {
                    "characterId": "xyera",
                    "expression": "neutral",
                    "position": "center",
                    "isSpeaking": false
                }
            ],
            "text": "...Xyera? Kau... nyata?",
            "next": "scene11_rip_11"
        },
        {
            "id": "scene11_rip_11",
            "type": "line",
            "speaker": "xyera",
            "expression": "smile",
            "characters": [
                {
                    "characterId": "xyera",
                    "expression": "smile",
                    "position": "center",
                    "isSpeaking": true
                }
            ],
            "text": "Selalu. Sudah. Ayo pulang.",
            "next": "scene11_rip_12"
        },
        {
            "id": "scene11_rip_12",
            "type": "narration",
            "text": "Tangan yang kuat menarik {playerName} berdiri. Cahaya putih memenuhi pandangan. Satu hal terakhir yang ia rasakan... kehangatan yang sudah lama ia rindukan.",
            "next": "scene11_rip_13"
        },
        {
            "id": "scene11_rip_13",
            "type": "scene-change",
            "targetSceneId": "scene12_hidden"
        }
    ]
}
